2	 * Minecraft: Java Edition — plugins, mods, datapacks and Modrinth modpacks.
3	 *
4	 * Server layout (itzg/minecraft-server, prisma/catalog.ts): `/opt/mc` on the
5	 * VM is the container's `/data`. Variant = itzg `TYPE` (worker/game-variant.ts):
6	 *
7	 *   paper / purpur / spigot / bukkit / folia  → plugin jars in /opt/mc/plugins
8	 *   fabric / quilt / forge / neoforge          → mod jars in    /opt/mc/mods
9	 *   any variant, vanilla included              → datapack zips in /opt/mc/<level-name>/datapacks
10	 *   modpack (.mrpack)                          → its server-side files + server overrides,
11	 *                                                only when loader + MC version match exactly
